<speak>
<s>This is your Jumu'ah briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">07082026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Japan has ordered nearly two hundred and sixty thousand people to evacuate ahead of Typhoon Dolphin, and cancelled five hundred flights... for a storm rated only Category One.</s> <s>The mismatch is the lesson: the category scale measures wind alone, while the Japan Meteorological Agency keys its warnings to rainfall accumulation and slope, because in this region the deaths come from landslides and flash flooding, not gusts.</s> <s>In Kumamoto, some six thousand seven hundred people are still displaced from last week's earthquake — and the rain arrives on ground already loosened.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Eleven civilians were wounded in the Saudi border province of Najran, among them a four-year-old child, in a strike the coalition attributes to Yemen's Houthi movement.</s> <s>The casualty list is the story — seven Saudis, one Yemeni, two Egyptians and a Pakistani, mostly migrant labourers and border residents who had no part in the coalition that began this war a decade ago.</s> <s>Najran and neighbouring Jizan are provinces where the fighting never actually paused, so Riyadh's warnings of escalation describe a threshold crossed for the capital, not for the frontier.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A truck bomb in Cúcuta wounded fourteen police officers and civilians days before Colombia's president-elect, Abelardo de la Espriella, takes office.</s> <s>The <sub alias="E L N">ELN</sub> has outlasted every peace process since nineteen sixty-four, and Colombia's framework of negotiating with each armed group separately rewards exactly this — a demonstration of leverage before talks open, not after.</s> <s>The incoming president's one-month ultimatum for the groups to disarm expired the same day as the blast.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Lawmakers in Khyber Pakhtunkhwa are asking to be shown the anti-militancy policy being carried out in their own province.</s> <s>That the request has to be made at all is the finding: counter-militancy in Pakistan is designed federally and executed by the military, while the provincial assembly holds law and order on paper and the casualty count in practice.</s> <s>A minister told the chamber the Swat bomber was a convicted criminal released before the attack — which is the kind of detail that oversight exists to catch.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Turkey's president sat down in Riyadh with Saudi Arabia's crown prince, Pakistan's prime minister and its army chief, Asim Munir.</s> <s>The composition matters more than the itinerary — Ankara and Riyadh spent a decade as rivals, and a field marshal in the delegation signals a security-guarantee track rather than a trade visit.</s> <s>Islamabad mediates the fragile ceasefire between Washington and Tehran, defends Saudi shipping under a mutual-defence pact, and wants deferred oil financing in return.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A month after losing at the Supreme Court, the American president signed fresh executive orders targeting birthright citizenship.</s> <s>The Fourteenth Amendment is a constitutional guarantee, not a statute the executive can redefine, so the orders can't change who is a citizen — but they instruct agencies to withhold passports and Social Security numbers, which produces the same result for a newborn until a court intervenes.</s> <s>Further legal challenges are expected, and until then the burden falls on infants and their parents.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Beijing has written Xinjiang's campaign-era restrictions on Uyghurs into national law.</s> <s>Measures once run as reversible regional policy are now binding statute for officials across the country — which hardens them against the argument that they were temporary.</s> <s>Governments that criticised what they called measures must now object to codified law, and that's a far harder diplomatic sentence to say.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Journalists have named two officers from the Syrian army's Sixty-First Brigade over the Saida al-Golan massacre in Quneitra, where thirteen bodies were thrown into a valley in twenty thirteen.</s> <s>The identification rests on witness testimony gathered only after the fall of Bashar al-Assad's government — evidence that existed for twelve years but couldn't be spoken.</s> <s>The families have the names now, and still no court, no prosecutor, and no charge.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nigeria's president reversed a freeze on Osun State's accounts one day after the anti-graft commission imposed it over an alleged eleven-billion-naira infraction.</s> <s>The timing sits days before the state's governorship election, and the commission must now return to court to vacate its own order.</s> <s>A court order that lasts a single day tells you something about where authority actually rests.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>India's parliament has cleared the way for fees on the Unified Payments Interface, the world's largest real-time retail payments network, free at the point of use since twenty twenty.</s> <s>The finance minister says any merchant discount rate would fall on merchants, not customers — but a corner shop running on single-digit margins prices that back into the shelf, so the distinction is an accounting one rather than an economic one.</s> <s>A steering committee under the National Payments Corporation will decide only after the bill takes effect, and much of the Global South is watching whether a free public rail can stay free once it's load-bearing.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The former security chief of South Africa's passenger rail agency exposed the investigation into himself by going to court to stop it.</s> <s>A police affidavit alleges firms linked to an alleged gang boss won roughly sixty million rand in Prasa subcontracts through his office — security contracting being the precise point where a utility gets captured, since the contracts written to stop cable theft are awarded by the office that profits from it continuing.</s> <s>Commuters, largely low-income, are still waiting for lines that closed years ago, and a full hearing on the legality of the searches is set.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Washington is paying four billion dollars to cancel offshore wind leases rather than build them.</s> <s>Germany's <sub alias="R W E">RWE</sub> alone collects one point two two billion, refunds of lease and permitting fees developers had already paid under the previous federal policy.</s> <s>Billions more in signed leases remain exposed to the same reversal, which is what policy risk costs when it's finally itemised.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Malaysia's refiners are running short of Gulf crude as the closure of the Strait of Hormuz reaches its first major Asian buyer.</s> <s>Replacement barrels exist, but they come from further away — and the shipping cost is the tax a chokepoint levies on everyone downstream of it.</s> <s>Malaysian refiners must now test substitute contracts across Southeast Asia, in sha'Allah before the shortfall reaches the pump.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Clinic visits in Pakistan's Chitral valley fell fifty-five percent in four days, and the clinics themselves are intact.</s> <s>What glacial lake outburst floods destroyed was the road, the bridge and the supply line — a meltwater lake builds behind a dam of loose rock, the dam fails, and a valley's worth of water arrives in minutes with no rain to warn anyone.</s> <s>Pakistan holds thousands of these lakes and one of the largest concentrations of this hazard outside the poles, while contributing a negligible share of the emissions warming them.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>China has issued its first five-year plan devoted entirely to climate, drawn up by the environment ministry alongside eighteen other departments.</s> <s>Previous plans folded emissions into energy and industrial targets; this one builds a single system covering emissions, carbon markets and adaptation together.</s> <s>Officials describe it as the main policy instrument for the rest of the decade, which makes its targets the ones worth reading closely.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Physicists working with the <sub alias="B E S three">BESIII</sub> collaboration in Beijing report that the particle known as X twenty-three seventy is made of pure force, not matter.</s> <s>A glueball is bound entirely from the carriers of the strong nuclear force, predicted by quantum chromodynamics in the nineteen seventies and unconfirmed for decades because glueballs mix indistinguishably with ordinary particles.</s> <s>The result was presented at the <sub alias="I C H E P">ICHEP</sub> conference in Brazil, and confirmation will need independent measurement.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Taiwan's economy is growing on artificial intelligence hardware while the economy most Taiwanese actually work in isn't growing at all.</s> <s>Advanced chipmaking is extraordinarily capital-intensive and employs comparatively few people, selling almost entirely abroad — so its currency and land-price effects squeeze the small manufacturers and services that employ everyone else, which is Dutch disease with a fab instead of an oil field.</s> <s>An institute analysis argues the boom complicates the American president's framing of the island as a negotiating chip, since indispensability concentrated in a handful of plants is both leverage and exposure.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>North Carolina's ports have reverted to processing cargo on paper after a cyber intrusion.</s> <s>Terminal software doesn't lift containers — it records which box sits where and which trucks may pass, so losing it doesn't stop the cranes, it erases the yard's index.</s> <s>Officials haven't attributed the breach, and it's the length of the recovery, not the intrusion itself, that will show up in shipping costs.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>American cities that cancelled licence-plate camera contracts after public campaigns are signing new ones with a different vendor, Axon, whose cameras mount on existing streetlamps and are built to blend in.</s> <s>The company already supplies police body cameras and the evidence software behind them, which means the surveillance and the record of it sit with one firm.</s> <s>A privacy campaign that wins a contract fight but not a policy has moved the cameras, not removed them.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>